# A Killer Among Us: "create ... a 1/1 red Goblin creature token. Then secretly choose Human, Merfolk, or Goblin." While it is
# a spell, Artificial Evolution replaces Goblin with Elf in its text (CR 612.1, 612.2), and the changed text stays with the
# permanent it becomes (CR 400.7a): its enters trigger makes an Elf token and offers Elf, not Goblin, to choose.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
A Killer Among Us
Artificial Evolution
Forest x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

